OL,5,G1400 A Place in the Sun
OL,6,     FCarol and Russell look for a place
OL,7,     Fin rural Coin in southern Spain. A
OL,8,     Fsolar-powered stunner leaves them
OL,9,     Fspeechless. A turnkey treat
OL,10,     Fprovides food for thought. Are
OL,11,     Feither of them just right?
OL,12,G1500 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FGloucestershire. Former property
OL,14,     Fdeveloper Ian hopes to make his
OL,15,     Fguests feel at home in his country
OL,16,     Fmansion on a night of so-called
OL,17,     F'healthy' grub, saucy attire and
OL,18,     Fnaked surprises. (Ep1/5)
