OL,11,     Ftight Yuletide timeline.
OL,12,G2000 Grand Designs
OL,13,     FPaul and Amy build a home made up
OL,14,     Fof five circular timber buildings
OL,15,     Flinked by raised walkways, beside
OL,16,     Fa Lincolnshire lake. But Paul's
OL,17,     Fhealth suffers as he struggles to
OL,18,     Ffinish it in a year.
